        <head>ANOTHER MARVELLOUS CURE BY CUTICURA</head>
        <p>ANOTHER MARVELLOUS CURE BY CUTICURA</p>
        <p>"My baby was afflicted with a loathsome running eczema. Two doctors treated him for three months, but he grew worse and his face was a sickening sight. We then started to use the Cuticura Remedies, and noticed an improvement at once. Within a fortnight the running had ceased and the scabs were nearly all dried off, and in a month his face was perfectly clear. You are at liberty to use this statement, as I should like all to know of the value of Cuticura.—William Herbert Quirk, No. r West End Cottages, Ruywood Road, N. Southampton."</p>
