        <p>VISIT TO CREWR AND BOLTON.—Sfr. Thomas Ison Oculist and Aurist (of Ison's Eye ind Ear Dispensary Leeds, established 1871), will visit the Royal Hotel, Crewe on Wednesday October 18th, hours 11 to 1 ; Swan Hotel, Bolton on Thursday October 19th, hours 1 to 7.30 and may be consulted on all cases of failing sight and hearing. New treatment without operation. Sufferers should avail themselves of the present oppor- tunity of consultation. Spectacles adapted for weak or defective sight. Those unable to avail themselves of a personal consultation should write to Leeds for printed form of questions to answer; forwarded free Letters to be addressed to 71,GnEAT GEORGE ST.,LEEDS.</p>
